-- title:
--   Actual original uniform-grid signed HJB plus drift residual is a.e. strongly measurable
-- statement:
--   On the real original Lévy process X, admissible dividend D and deterministic cofinal physical grid, the exact full signed B source in canonical original stopped-cell witness 2bc848f9, including interior left-limit HJB generator sum and original negative-jump drift residual sum, is a.e. strongly measurable. This is proved by joining separately Proved original generator measurability (59dcd3f0) and BV negative-jump residual measurability (6d55dddd). Combined with the strict-payoff positivity plus source pathwise bound, it enables the novel L1 norm squeeze helper rather than imposing a global derivative bound.

